      (mul_inv_le_iff₀ sqrt_one_add_sq_pos).2 r.2.2⟩⟩, ?_⟩
    rwa [ht _ (mul_pos (lt_of_lt_of_le (mul_pos ha sqrt_one_add_sq_pos) r.2.1)
